<section class="panel" aria-labelledby="guild-ranks-title">
    <h2 id="guild-ranks-title">Grades et permissions</h2>
    <p>Une priorité plus petite indique un grade supérieur. Sans grade personnalisé, un membre ne dispose d'aucune permission déléguée. Le commandement reste distinct des grades.</p>
    <p>Les grades concernent votre guilde. Vos alliances personnelles restent gérées dans <a href="{{ path('app_diplomacy',{tab:'relations'}) }}">Commandants</a>.</p>
    {% for rank in ranks %}
        <details>
            <summary>{{ rank.name }} · priorité {{ rank.position }}</summary>
            <ul>{% for permission in rank.permissions %}<li>{{ rankPermissionLabels[permission]|default(permission) }}</li>{% else %}<li>Aucune permission déléguée.</li>{% endfor %}</ul>
            {% if own.leader.id==membership.id %}{% include 'player/_guild_rank_form.html.twig' with {rank:rank, formKey:'rank-'~rank.id} %}{% endif %}
        </details>
    {% else %}<p>Aucun grade personnalisé.</p>{% endfor %}
    {% if own.leader.id==membership.id %}
        <details><summary>Créer un grade</summary>{% include 'player/_guild_rank_form.html.twig' with {rank:null, formKey:'rank-new'} %}</details>
    {% endif %}
    {% for assignment in rankAssignments %}
        {% set member=assignment.member %}
        <form method="post">
            <input type="hidden" name="_token" value="{{ csrf_token('diplomacy') }}">
            <input type="hidden" name="action" value="rank_assign">
            <input type="hidden" name="target" value="{{ member.id }}">
            <input type="hidden" name="expected_rank" value="{{ member.rank.id|default(0) }}">
            <label for="member-rank-{{ member.id }}">Grade de {{ member.playerUniverse.displayName }}</label>
            <select id="member-rank-{{ member.id }}" name="rank">
                <option value="0" {% if not member.rank %}selected{% endif %}>Membre · sans permission déléguée</option>
                {% for rank in assignment.choices %}<option value="{{ rank.id }}" {% if member.rank and member.rank.id==rank.id %}selected{% endif %}>{{ rank.name }}</option>{% endfor %}
            </select>
            <button class="secondary">Attribuer le grade à {{ member.playerUniverse.displayName }}</button>
        </form>
    {% endfor %}
</section>
